  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn></math> molal solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has a density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The molarity of the solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>. (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>[Atomic masses: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>]</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> molal <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi></math> solvent has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> moles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi></math></p><p>so, wt. of solute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>56</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>364</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi></math></p><p>wt. of solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>364</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1364</mn></math></p><p>Volume of solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1364</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>89</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi></math></p><p>Molarity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>mole</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>solute</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mi>solution</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>in</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>Litre</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00</mn></math></p>"
